&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1j4zddb&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;Who we are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Geotab ® is a global leader in IoT and connected transportation and certified “Great Place to Work™.” We are a company of diverse and talented individuals who work together to help businesses grow and succeed, and increase the safety and sustainability of our communities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Geotab is advancing security, connecting commercial vehicles to the internet and providing web-based analytics to help customers better manage their fleets. Geotab’s open platform and Geotab Marketplace ®, offering hundreds of third-party solution options, allows both small and large businesses to automate operations by integrating vehicle data with their other data assets. Processing billions of data points a day, Geotab leverages data analytics and machine learning to improve productivity, optimize fleets through the reduction of fuel consumption, enhance driver safety and achieve strong compliance to regulatory changes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Our team is growing and we’re looking for people who follow their passion, think differently and want to make an impact. Ours is a fast paced, ever changing environment. Geotabbers accept that challenge and are willing to take on new tasks and activities - ones that may not always be described in the initial job description. Join us for a fulfilling career with opportunities to innovate, great benefits, and our fun and inclusive work culture. Reach your full potential with Geotab. To see what it’s like to be a Geotabber, check out our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineHover css-sbvzk&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.geotab.com/blog/&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and follow us @InsideGeotab on&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineHover css-sbvzk&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidegeotab/&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;Who you are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,0&quot;&gt;We are always looking for amazing talent who can contribute to our growth and deliver results!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,2&quot;&gt; Geotab is seeking a Global Operations Intern (Product Ops Focus)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,3&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,4&quot;&gt; who will play a hands-on part in maintaining data accuracy across our Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP) systems, smoothing out product labeling workflows, coordinating international test device deployments and providing general operational project support to our internal teams and external partners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,5&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,6&quot;&gt; If you love technology, and are keen to join an industry leader — we would love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,7&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0,0,0&quot;&gt;As a Global Operations Intern (Product Ops Focus)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0,0,2&quot;&gt; your key area of responsibility will be maintaining ERP data and SKU accuracy, assisting with product labeling and workflow resolution, coordinating import and customs logistics, and supporting new product testing setups and partner engagement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0,0,3&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0,0,4&quot;&gt; You will need to work closely with internal teams, external regional partners, freight forwarders, customs brokers, and project leads.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0,0,5&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0,0,6&quot;&gt; To be successful in this role you will be an enthusiastic, resourceful, and proactive self-starter with excellent written and verbal communication skills in English.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0,0,7&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0,0,8&quot;&gt; In addition, the successful candidate will have strong problem-solving skills, an operational mindset, familiarity with ERP systems and Excel/Google Sheets, and an excellent understanding of AI in day-to-day operational practice.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0,0,9&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;How you&#39;ll make an impact:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_77b0e65fd32b82df-46&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0,0&quot;&gt;Audit and maintain SKU catalog accuracy across core ERP platforms; identify, troubleshoot, and re-catalog missing or dropped SKUs to ensure unbroken order fulfillment and reporting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_77b0e65fd32b82df-47&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0,0&quot;&gt;Assist with product labeling governance by implementing and documenting standard operating procedures (SOPs) based on established solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_77b0e65fd32b82df-48&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0,0&quot;&gt;Perform routine system health checks to ensure operational data consistency across warehousing and dispatch systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_77b0e65fd32b82df-49&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0,0&quot;&gt;Assist in securing local regulatory permits and clearance documentation required for importing hardware, with a specific focus on specialized test devices entering Singapore and other APAC regions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_77b0e65fd32b82df-50&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0,0&quot;&gt;Monitor shipment trajectories and ensure seamless hand-offs between freight forwarders, customs brokers, and internal teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
